0 concurrent users produce only 2-3 in-flight requests and the\nconnection pool peaks at 8 of 80. That is well short of saturation, which is\nthe regime where connections-per-request decides throughput.\n\n-DdisablePauses=true opts any profile out, bracketing the dense end of\nclosed-loop usage. SMOKE already disabled pauses unconditionally and keeps\ndoing so. Open injection would also saturate but does not fit DHIS2, which\nserves a known set of health workers who wait when the system slows rather\nthan arriving independently of its state.","author":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"},"id":"73412a5e42685e23792f61f03cca1dac88cb0449","tree_id":"72e9edb0fc2d5ba13fdbfcb25ef624d3dda5080d","timestamp":"2026-09-15T08:20:09Z","committer":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java. Contains the 